<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA says 85mln punt auction cover 2.38 time.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA says 85mln punt auction cover 2.38 time.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Tuesday that an 85 million punt auction in the 8.0 percent Treasury bond due 2006 was covered 2.38 times.  </p>
<p>The highest accepted price was 110.61 and the highest annual yield was 6.42 percent, the NTMA said.</p>
<p>The lowest accepted price was 110.55 and the lowest annual yield was 6.43 percent with 30 percent of each bid filled.</p>
<p>A non-competitive auction of 17 million punts for primary dealers was done at a price of 110.58, the NTMA said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
